        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠷᠢᠭᠤᠨ ᠰᠡᠳᠭᠢᠯᠳᠡᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠰ</unicode>
          <transcript>ariγun -- kymys</transcript>
