        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠰᠠᠷᠠᠬᠤᠢ ᠨᠢᠭᠦᠯᠡᠰᠺᠦᠢ ᠰᠡᠳᠭᠢᠯᠳᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>asaraxui nigyleskyi -- </transcript>
          <definition> Compassionate, merciful</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠭᠤ ᠰᠡᠳᠭᠢᠯᠳᠡᠢ</unicode>
